        "text_VB7Uzj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>True to the values and philosophy of the family business, which has been rooted in the heart of Neuchâtel, the cradle of Swiss watchmaking, since 1906, Michaud Jewellers has been present in the prestigious Valais resort of Verbier since 2011. Here, the boutique offers a unique interpretation of mountain-style sophistication, blending the modernity of a watchmaking atelier with the warm, inviting ambiance of an alpine chalet. Set in a breathtaking natural environment, Michaud’s interior invites clients into an elegant alpine cocoon, where the authentic charm of noble materials meets refined contemporary touches. With each piece, Michaud Jewellers continues a tradition of excellence, offering creations that tell a story: yours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "heading_r7Hbbb": {
