          "settings": {
            "heading": "testimonial",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_C6PUPR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As Jewellers dedicated to excellence, we chose to partner with Shamballa Jewels for their unwavering commitment to craftsmanship and innovation. Their unique approach, blending tradition with contemporary design, aligns perfectly with the values we uphold in our selections. Shamballa Jewels constantly pushes the boundaries of high-end jewellery, drawing inspiration from spirituality and using only the finest materials. This collaboration is a true source of inspiration, and together, we bring our clients pieces that tell a unique and timeless story.</p>"
          }
