          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Since 2011, The House of Michaud has established itself in the renowned Valais resort of Verbier, presenting a unique take on mountain-style elegance. The store beautifully blends the contemporary aesthetic of watch boutiques with the cozy, wooden charm of alpine chalets. With its newly designed interior, Michaud offers a serene alpine atmosphere that invites you into a comforting retreat.</p><p><strong>Opening hours:</strong><br/>Monday – Sunday: <br/>10:00 - 12:30 | 14:00 - 19:00</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Michaud+SA+Verbier/@46.0953407,7.2260398,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x478ece32d606a399:0x2782faba3c68020e!8m2!3d46.0953371!4d7.2309107!16s%2Fg%2F1hc95y6f5?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTAyNy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Michaud Verbier\">Rue de Médran 5<br/>1936 Verbier, Switzerland</a></p>",
